{"text": "TO:\n\nTulsa County Sheriff\u2019s Office\nInter-Office Memorandum\n\nChief Deputy M. Robinette\nChief Deputy J. Bowman\n\nFROM: Undersheriff R. Weigel Quy Q\n\nDATE: January 12, 2016\n\nSUBJECT: Budget Shortfall\n\nThere is a budget shortfall concerning the bills at DLM, the steps we will take to\nrecover from this are as follows:\n\nThere will be no longevity pay; this funding will be used to assist in the\nrecovery effort of the budget shortfall.\n\nAll work on the training center will cease until such time the DLM budget\nshortfall has been corrected.\n\nIf necessary review the deputy positions at DLM for a possible reduction in\nstaff.\n\nAs per contact I have given Physical Therapy of Tulsa three month notice\nfor termination of the contact.\n\nThe radio crisis at DLM will be alleviated by moving the used radios for the\noperation division when the new radios are programed.",
"words": [
